OL,3,AFive Israelis wounded and two suspected
OL,4,APalestinian attackers killed in West
OL,5,ABank shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive Israelis have been wounded and two
OL,8,Fsuspected Palestinian attackers killed
OL,9,Fby Israeli security forces following a
OL,10,Fshooting in the occupied West Bank,
OL,11,FIsraeli officials say.
OL,13,FFootage verified by the BBC shows an
OL,14,Fintense gun battle between soldiers and
OL,15,Fthe gunmen, at a military checkpoint at
OL,16,Fthe entrance to the city of Hebron.
OL,18,FIn response, Israel's Prime Minister
OL,19,FBenjamin Netanyahu said he had ordered
OL,20,Fthe military to prepare for a full
OL,21,Flockdown of the West Bank, beginning
OL,22,Flater on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
