OL,3,AFive Israelis wounded and two suspected
OL,4,APalestinian attackers killed in West
OL,5,ABank shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe attack comes at a time of high
OL,8,Ftensions, with extremist Jewish
OL,9,Fsettlers targeting Palestinians during
OL,10,Fthe annual olive harvest, and Israel's
OL,11,Fgeneral election taking place in four
OL,12,Fdays time.
